{"status":true,"data":{"id":143,"name":"Enable Building in Caves","slug":"enable-building-in-caves","mod_id":"AllowBuildInCaves","shortDescription":"Allows building in caves and removes parts of cave entrances","description":"##Building in caves\r\n\r\n\r\n###Features\r\n- Allows you to build inside caves, cellars and ice caves.\r\n- Opens up cave entrances to carry logs or stones in.\r\n- Allows you to keep logs / stones when entering or leaving bunkers.\r\n- You can even get power inside by placing solar panels outside the cave.\r\n\r\n\r\n##Configuration:\r\n- **Dont open Caves:** When enabled the game will not open up cave entrances when loading into the world. Does require a restart when changed.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Allow actors to traverse caves:** When enabled the game will allow actors to go in and out of caves.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Allow GPS to lose signal:** When enabled the GPS will lose signal when entering a cave, when disabled it will still show the outside map.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Switch to City filter when entering Cave (Blue Fix):** Will switch the filter to City when entering a cave to remove the blue hue inside caves.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Keep Logs or Stones when entering Caves or Bunkers:** When entering a cave or bunker with an animation, any logs or stone in your hands will be returned to you once the animation has finished.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Easy Bunkers:** Easy transportation of logs or stones into bunkers, by just throwing them onto the entrance **(disabled by default)**\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Disable collect Items UI inside Caves:** Will disable the *Collect x of Items* reminder inside caves, will also disable the reminder when blueprints are placed inside caves.\r\n\r\n\r\n###For even more building in caves fun you should also install: https://sotf-mods.com/mods/tempbito/placestructureanywhere\r\n\r\n\r\n>Enjoy and have fun!\r\n\r\n\r\n##Please report any issues you may encounter, thanks!","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":"client","isNSFW":false,"isApproved":true,